    "trigger_card_number": 851,
    "title": "第19课：简单将来时",
    "header_color": "green",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "简单将来时（futur simple）＝ will。",
          "从现在起完全规则化——所有动词",
          "使用相同的词尾，直接加在不定式后：",
          "",
          "je charger-ai   ＝ 我将充电     按 1",
          "tu chargeras    ＝ 你将充电",
          "il/elle chargera ＝ 他／她将充电",
          "nous chargerons ＝ 我们将充电",
          "vous chargerez  ＝ 你们将充电",
          "ils chargeront  ＝ 他们将充电",
          "",
          "-RE 动词需先去掉末尾的 -e：",
          "vendre → je vendrai",
          "",
          "不规则词干与条件式相同",
          "（第4层级）：être→ser-，avoir→aur-，",
          "aller→ir-，faire→fer-，venir→viendr-。"
        ],
        "pronunciation": "Leçon dix-neuf",
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "je chargerai, tu chargeras, il chargera, nous chargerons, ils chargeront"
        }
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "简单将来时 vs. 最近将来时：",
          "",
          "最近将来时（aller + 不定式）——   按 1",
          "用于近期、计划好的口语表达：",
          "Je vais charger le téléphone.",
          "（我要给手机充电。）",
          "",
          "简单将来时——用于较远未来、更",
          "正式或书面语、程序说明：       按 2",
          "L'application se chargera",
          "automatiquement.",
          "（该应用将自动充电。）",
          "",
          "两者皆正确；日常口语中",
          "最近将来时更常见。"
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "je vais charger le téléphone",
          "2": "l'application se chargera automatiquement"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
